Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And the two traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.39,0:00:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,For re-employed pensioners,\NParagraph 6.7 computes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.19,0:00:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,House Rent Allowance on\Npay plus pension, subject
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,to the ceiling of the\Nmaximum pay of the post.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.72,0:00:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And for employees outside the\NFundamental Rules and the C.C.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave Rules, Paragraph\N6.8 allows only forty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.03,0:00:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,days, extended to one\Nhundred and eighty for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,tuberculosis, cancer and similar ailments.
